{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Decode unmarked payloads with the context-free delegate method.** Initial invocation inputs and raw callback/invoke results are encoded through `delegate.serialize(value)`, but this calls the context-aware deserializer. A delegate whose contextual encoding differs will therefore fail every raw boundary. Use the original `deserialize` overload for unmarked data and reserve contextual deserialization for filesystem envelopes; add a contextual-delegate regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7or05w","finding_digest":"0a2e2160c7657441bb7f4c39b86a245c4917c71302cb5fb3e9248b80a4c265b3","finding_id":"arf_v1_bixccyghmv2edo37jq43q2relr","finding_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::deserialize::unmarked-delegate-context-mismatch","identity_key":"sdk/serde/filesystemserdes::deserialize::unmarked-delegate-context-mismatch","line":128,"observation_digest":"66715876cf86018bf69fab002f10db954411316410dbf70721aefc25010ea4f8","observation_id":"aro_v1_mzyvq5wpqyayx5u7vmac6eg3sv","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/FileSystemSerDes.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T11:51:39Z","review_id":"arr_v1_4cfcdhnhu4cjdwq5ydjdu7e23t","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"75447029a3e45a916d1b015a190c241b810017ed","reviewer":"codex","start_line":128,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_3lrexpzek66ub4uidwelz5gqcf"},"pull_request":{"number":672},"record_id":"art_v1_eih32tdofbyptuljccykpvntoc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T11:51:39Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
